    "description": "Title\n: Framed Wall Art Lot w Crystal Rock Texture 2 Piece Home Decor Silver Frame\nSize\n: Approx. 14\" x 10\"\nColor\n: Silver Frame/Clear Crystal/White Mat\nDepartment\n: For The Home > Home Decor\nCategory\n: Hard Goods\nDescription\n: Elevate your living space with this captivating set of two framed crystal artworks. Each piece features a central arrangement of clear quartz crystals set against a textured gray fabric background and artistically matted to enhance their elegant appeal. Encased in gleaming silver-tone frames, these works blend natural beauty with modern design, making them perfect for contemporary homes or sophisticated offices. The 3D crystal formation catches the light beautifully, creating dazzling reflections and adding depth to any wall. Sturdy hardware on the back ensures easy, secure hanging, while the neutral colors blend seamlessly with a variety of decor styles. Ideal as a statement piece or a thoughtful gift, these artworks are a unique way to bring natural elements indoors. Authenticated by a numbered marking on the reverse, this set offers genuine, one-of-a-kind charm and enduring style.\nSOME ITEMS CONTAIN AGE/WEAR/DAMAGE/STAINS\nSOLD AS IS\nNew Braunfels\nNotes\nLOCAL PICK-UP IS NOW AVAILABLE.\nPLEASE CONTACT CUSTOMER SERVICE TO SCHEDULE AN APPOINTMENT. YOU MUST MAKE AN APPOINTMENT FOR LOCAL PICK-UP ITEMS. LOCAL PICK-UP IS AVAILABLE MONDAY-FRIDAY 8am-4pm CST\nIF YOU HAVE ANY QUESTIONS PLEASE CONTACT OUR\nCUSTOMER SERVICE DEPARTMENT AT\n(726) 237-7616\nOR CLICK ON THE CUSTOMER SERVICE TAB IN SHOPGOODWILL.COM\nUsed Items Disclaimer\nThis is a pre-owned item and is being sold “AS IS ” If you have any questions concerning this item, feel free to contact us\nAll items (including new) are donated and may pick up dust/debris from warehouse – wash/clean before you wear/use\nWe describe our items to the best of our ability and try to incorporate as much research as possible with books and internet\nHowever, we are NOT experts in any field\nAll measurements for items are approximated\nGoodwill helps change lives\nthrough the power of work!\nThanks for shopping\nGoodwill Industries Of San Antonio!\nTerms of Sale\nOrders must be paid for within ten (10) days from the close of auction, unless other arrangements have been agreed upon.  All orders not paid within ten (10) days from the close of auction will be resold without further notice.",
