    "description": "Golden Healer Quartz Polished Specimen\nNatural Crystal Flame Carving\nPolished Stone, 7 Inches, 2.28 Pounds\nA striking specimen of Golden Healer Quartz, characterized by its warm honey and amber hues resulting from natural iron oxide inclusions. This piece has been expertly carved into a flame-inspired freeform shape and polished to a high-gloss finish, highlighting the intricate internal veining, banding, and crystalline structures. These specimens are highly prized by mineral collectors and enthusiasts of natural stone decor for their vibrant coloration and organic aesthetic.\nHand-polished Golden Healer Quartz featuring characteristic yellow and golden-orange limonite staining\nCarved flame silhouette with a flat-ground base for stable upright display\nDisplays natural internal fractures, phantoms, and inclusions typical of authentic quartz specimens\nDimensions: 7 inches x 4 inches x 2.5 inches; Weight: 2.28 lbs\nCondition:\nThe stone surface is smooth with a brilliant luster. Natural surface-reaching fissures and deep internal inclusions are present, which are characteristic of natural quartz and are not considered defects. The base is stable and flat. No significant post-polishing chips or impact damage observed on the carved edges or points.",
